 "titulo": "The new headstone had my boss's name ⚰️ Part 3 #horror #shorts",
 "capa": "FILL IT AGAIN",
 "descripcion": "At dawn the grave was open and empty. Rule four: fill it before anyone sees. Then Eli read the name on the new headstone, and found the old keeper's diary.\n\nWould you keep the job?\n\nNarrated fiction. New part every day.\n#horror #horrorstories #scarystories #survival #creepypasta",
 "visual": "3d",
 "lineas": [
  {
   "texto": "Part three. At *dawn*, the hand sinks back into the ground.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Eli climbs down and walks to the grave from 1961.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It's open. A deep, clean hole. And it's *empty*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Rule four. If a grave is open at dawn, fill it before anyone sees.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "He grabs a shovel and works until his hands bleed.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "When he finishes, he notices the headstone has changed.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It's new, polished, and it carries a different name.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Walter Grimes. The old groundskeeper. Died last night.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Stay, because the shed had one more thing Eli hadn't read.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Behind the rules, there's a notebook with forty years of handwriting.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Filled it again. Filled it again. Filled it again.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "The last page is from yesterday, in shaky letters.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "It wants a keeper. *Eli will be next*.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "Eli doesn't quit. Someone has to fill the holes.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "So now he locks the gates at ten and never steps on fresh dirt.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "But last night, at home, he woke up at 1:10.",
   "pausa": 0.5
  },
  {
   "texto": "And under his own bedroom floor, something was *digging*.",
   "pausa": 0.8
  },
  {
   "texto": "If you ever hear it, remember: it isn't yours.",
   "pausa": 0.3
  }
 ],
